128
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:49,700
May we have an
Awesome Blossom, please?

129
00:05:49,724 --> 00:05:51,726
Extra awesome. Now it is done.

130
00:05:52,018 --> 00:05:53,103
So, if you have a...

