178
00:08:06,569 --> 00:08:07,946
Yeah. Oh, yeah.

179
00:08:08,029 --> 00:08:09,739
All right, let's
get this started.

180
00:08:09,823 --> 00:08:12,951
I'm gonna be reading
the action descriptions

181
