I have time.

204
00:09:18,808 --> 00:09:20,977
<i>I want my baby back,
baby back, baby back</i>

205
00:09:21,061 --> 00:09:23,354
<i>I want my baby back,
baby back, baby back</i>

206
00:09:23,438 --> 00:09:24,999
<i>I want my baby-back,
baby-back, baby-back</i>

207
00:09:25,023 --> 00:09:27,525
<i>Chili's baby-back ribs</i> I want
my baby-back, baby-back

